```mermaid
%% The front door's version of the path: the same six boxes, no side branches. The two-layer one is `path.mmd` on the
%% quickstart; README.md carries a copy of this file, because GitHub renders mermaid but cannot include one.
%% The explicit fills and colours are the dark-mode fix: Mermaid's default theme is dark text on a transparent
%% background, which vanishes on Material's dark page, so every node carries its own background.
flowchart LR
    D["market data"] --> B["L2 book<br/>queue explicit"] --> S["strategy"] --> G{"risk gate"} --> M["venue<br/>three engines"] --> L["ledger<br/>[PNL] · [RECON]"]

    classDef box fill:#eef4fb,stroke:#2b6ca3,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0f2438
    classDef gate fill:#fdf3e3,stroke:#b07d1c,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#3b2a06
    classDef good fill:#eaf6ef,stroke:#2c7d54,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0d2f21
    class D,B,S,M box
    class G gate
    class L good
```
